 "paragraphs": [
  "“Hello! We are here to get the third riddle for the password to the party,” Aliya announced.",
  "“Welcome,” one of the bats greeted them. “This is your last stop. You can go to the party if you solve this riddle. First, what is your total from the last two puzzles?”",
  "“58,” Zade answered.",
  "“Perfect. Now, listen carefully. The party is in honor of my arrival. I only come in the spring. My color is sunny and bright. I stand outside this cave. How many of me do you see?”"
 ],
